body:
Hi! I have a documentation issue on InstantSearch.js. I could not find what I was looking for on the page "[Common parameters](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets-common-api.html)".

Trying desperately to get the Hits widget to work. It doesn't recognize any referential tags, meaning I can't display search results. Currently, they just come up empty.

This is my widget. As you can see, I got desperate but none of the bellow works.

```js
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.hits({
    container: "#hits",
    templates: {
      empty: "No Results.",
      item:
        "{{html}} {{value}} {{title}}<em>Hit {{objectID}}</em>: {{_highlightResult.title.value}}"
    },
    escapeHits: true,
    transformItems: items => items.map(item => item)
  })
);
```
